{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4001_045kar", "source_sha256": "14e9e759407a45f54026c3d84d97d73fbecd46bac4ce0ae9e622e76b53d5176f", "ja": "あうう、ど、どうしよう……。", "zh": "啊呜呜，怎、怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4002_p", "source_sha256": "53a9a224bcb9d6d66896a37dec3d5a10ff9c1e35579e619757faf788a76fb13b", "ja": "どうしたんだ、可憐。何か困ってるのか？", "zh": "怎么了，可怜？遇到了什么困难吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4003_045kar", "source_sha256": "44d8bd90800bd66852adb50c7099edb0d4e7e9eda4c17a782a6d2e077c4efd2d", "ja": "は、はい……。今日、出演する番組に……\n『アイドルの私服拝見♪』ってコーナーがあって……。", "zh": "是、是的……今天要参加的节目中……\n有『偶像便服大揭密♪』的单元……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4004_045kar", "source_sha256": "f41412b532362f33fabe052da206fce6a17c94a800e4fc3f97f6896330720493", "ja": "で、でも……私が普段、着ている服は……。\nとても、ひ、人には紹介できないもので……。", "zh": "但、但是……我平常穿的衣服……\n实、实在不好意思介绍给大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4005_p", "source_sha256": "2a445e75581c3d2aea9b799a44109affb43cacaf8a20302f51c9c5eb120321a6", "ja": "え？　そんなことはないんじゃ……。\nほら、今着てるその服だって、私服だし……。", "zh": "咦？没这种事吧……\n看，你今天穿的就是便服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4006_045kar", "source_sha256": "9e86224db8f41888dfcdb8f7a29260798385f2130befb2e931ea5d35d97d57ee", "ja": "こ、これは、よそ行き用の私服なんです……！\n部屋着は……とても、み、見せられません……。", "zh": "这、这是正式场合穿的便服……！\n在家穿的衣服……实在、无法见人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4007_p", "source_sha256": "49099060393eff11d5d65a3f7b6985b4fff858afbe3b5cac6f5abd4e26314810", "ja": "そ、そうか。つまり可憐は、どんな服を普段着として\n紹介するか、悩んでるんだな？　じゃあ……。", "zh": "这、这样啊，也就是说，可怜在烦恼要把什么样的\n服装当作平常穿的衣服，介绍给大家吧？那……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4008", "source_sha256": "75a9a0603533979d623ed05da802803108445c2f153816d2a5502dbc9b9fb9dd", "ja": "コスプレしてると\n言う", "zh": "说自己在做\n角色扮演", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4009", "source_sha256": "fe2478854ffad6cd8ac86cc13850ea09920276e5dae9492f8aa694468504f8ad", "ja": "よそ行きの服について\n語ればいい", "zh": "介绍正式场合\n穿的衣服就好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4010", "source_sha256": "e53803c84bb637d06a433e8c031011efeea7c534e1df7b07b8488db7ada098c9", "ja": "正直に\n普段の姿を暴露", "zh": "诚实公开\n平常的模样", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4100_p", "source_sha256": "0ba15a4c8854894698447dd173293cd1e6ba812a44fe28e716d219c6826da444", "ja": "いつもはコスプレしてる、って言うのはどうだ？", "zh": "说自己平常都在做角色扮演怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4101_045kar", "source_sha256": "b1148117c4c5bb20794a644d9a21620ec5d917ae7a60f4bce822e8ea593e32fd", "ja": "ええっ……コ、コスプレですか……！？\nそ、そういうのも、アリ……なんでしょうか……？", "zh": "咦咦……角、角色扮演吗……！？\n这、这种回答，也……行得通吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4102_p", "source_sha256": "58526cf0f477001bb11c746e8b245f8c721ed9af87b31447208db1d0d743a938", "ja": "もちろんアリだよ。可憐のその服装だって、\nなりたい自分のコスプレ……みたいなものなんだろう？", "zh": "当然行得通，可怜你这身衣服，\n也像是在扮演理想中的自己……这种感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4103_045kar", "source_sha256": "5cd15b6ff6010fa7bd61f53876b4a984e0d1b112196ea515c7e7c3ea8c3bc406", "ja": "あ……は、はい……そう、なんです……。\nわ、私……堂々とした自分に、なりたくて……。", "zh": "啊……是、是的……就是这样……\n我、我想……变成大大方方的自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4104_045kar", "source_sha256": "63a7c24cd024b1876d0bbefdf2c223ed9bc1ce4d9c3ed0967efbfb95c1a67c17", "ja": "……なんだか、すごく気が楽になりました……。\n私……こ、この服のことを、話そうと思います……！", "zh": "……总觉得，心情变得很轻松了……\n我……打、打算介绍这身衣服……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4105_045kar", "source_sha256": "dd59dbfc750dc485f3d7087bb063b9dbcaa46a968502ac85614fceaeb3f31521", "ja": "{$P$}さん……私のことを\nわかってくれて、ありがとうございます……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……谢谢你\n这么了解我……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4200_p", "source_sha256": "1d073614793f08bb69d2cd3d884b27a9d9a360580366e9de187f2a2f5970a3a8", "ja": "その、今、着てる服について\n語ればいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "谈谈你今天穿的衣服\n就好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4201_p", "source_sha256": "94f7ac56635cc5a6545384fe36e496fb5f14000b055a71f9f96c28ff398c6ad8", "ja": "可憐はよそ行きだっていうけど……それだって、\nちゃんと、可憐の私服だと思うぞ？", "zh": "虽然可怜你说是正式场合穿的……\n但我认为这确实也是可怜的便服喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4202_045kar", "source_sha256": "65ccf0844dde131c99c35589a82d68af5f58ca6f5b0dbdcb7221aa9cc70112df", "ja": "この、着飾った姿も……本当の私……？", "zh": "这盛装打扮的模样……也是真正的我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4203_045kar", "source_sha256": "8f0d4fea6bec82a12c36e31165656e9b8213a49ab61d4e6000e37e943c5bf906", "ja": "わ、わかりました。この服を、番組で、紹介します！\n……や、優しいんですね{$P$}さん。", "zh": "我、我明白了，我会在节目上介绍这身衣服！\n……你、你人真好呢，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4300_p", "source_sha256": "e2a2a7ad059ff53ad500be2d0812fb7ed030a281e1748004631382e02bafcecc", "ja": "いっそ包み隠さず、正直に\n普段の格好を見せたら、どうだろう？", "zh": "干脆不要隐藏，\n诚实展现出平常的模样，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4301_045kar", "source_sha256": "defc2cb2e02e90c092eeb53a61bce480622672bf8b62900d27a066e1429cd4a3", "ja": "だ、ダメです……！　こればっかりは……\nあ、あんな姿でいるなんて、絶対、話せません……！", "zh": "不、不行的……！这个万万不行……\n我、我绝对说不出平常的自己是那副模样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_4302_045kar", "source_sha256": "d357258cc76c58be2cc5a886e85513b8fe4f9e3465dbde2b9fb44e831d4922a0", "ja": "番組では、この、よそゆきの服について話します……。\n本当の姿のことは……勇気が持てるまで、秘密で……。", "zh": "在节目上，我会介绍这套正式场合的衣服……\n真正的样子……要保密到我有勇气为止……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
